<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>{{ appName }}</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: sans-serif; margin: 40px; }
    h1 { color: #333; }
    .demo-link { background: #0066cc; color: white; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin: 5px; }
    .demo-link:hover { background: #0055aa; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Welcome to {{ appName }}!</h1>
  <p>Version: {{ version }} ({{ getYear() }})</p>
  <p>Hello, {{ userName }}!</p>

  <h2>Demo Routes</h2>
  <p><a href="/home" class="demo-link">/home</a> Inline template with pipe syntax (|>)</p>
  <p><a href="/security" class="demo-link">/security</a> Security features: sanitize filter, auto-toJSON in script context</p>
</body>
</html>
